<title>CROATIA: Croatian Sept real wage index 107.3 vs Aug 110.4.</title>
<headline>Croatian Sept real wage index 107.3 vs Aug 110.4.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		SEPTEMBER     AUGUST    SEPT '95</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1995)    107.3	 110.4	100.6</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)		2,028	 2,085	1,839</p>
<p>NOTE -- September nominal wages fell to 2,005 from 2,064 kuna in August in the goods and services sector and to 2,093 from 2,141 kuna in the public sector.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
